      "statement": "LangChain unit tests are organized in tests/unit_tests/ by module (runnables/, callbacks/, language_models/, etc.), with each module optionally defining a conftest.py for module-specific fixtures and configuration, following pytest's fixture discovery hierarchy from root conftest to module conftest to test file.",
